  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study and intervention plan Just Energy Transition Partnership Indonesia and South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this study, a meaningful Dutch contribution to the Just Energy Transition Partnership in Indonesia and South Africa is formulated. It also defines how to best leverage existing Dutch facilities, programmes, and networks to mobilize investments and funding that can contribute to the Just Energy Transition in Indonesia and South Africa.</narrative>
